# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env (it carries a write token).
# Minimal scope: a Sanity token with read + write on dataset `production` of
# project `aitdwcxh` only. Reads (quest list, sweep log) work without it;
# Verify / Flag taps and workflow-state chips need it.
VITE_SANITY_WRITE_TOKEN=sk-your-read-write-token-here
